BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 536.65 Tm ([COMPUTERSHARE - 79d39hagJ6U @ 00:00:40].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 521.42 Tm (Learn the statutes, regulations, and actual state practice before the auditor asks. Jennifer Borden says) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 506.20 Tm (auditor interpretations often do not line up with what the statutes require, and holders are no longer afraid to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 490.97 Tm (say no, even if it leads to litigation [COMPUTERSHARE - 03CoUEgqdzg @ 00:01:47].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 475.75 Tm (Hunt for exemptions before remitting. Kodiak counts about 100 healthcare exemption opportunities,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 460.52 Tm (including recoupment, business-to-business, and de minimis, and aims to be compliant but not overly) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 445.30 Tm (compliant [Kodiak Solutions - 2BplqmdsUpU @ 00:28:08].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 430.07 Tm (When calling a state about where to send property, give a scenario instead of a yes-or-no question. States) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 414.85 Tm (sometimes agree to send property where the owner is most likely to look, but scale the effort to the amount:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 399.62 Tm (a $75 check does not justify the work a $75,000 check does [ucproput - 3B5mPVcKPDE @ 00:11:13].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 377.40 Tm (Where Practitioners Disagree & Alternative Playbooks) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 355.17 Tm (The sharpest split in holder defense is whether to fold early or fight. Jennifer Borden, an attorney with) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 339.95 Tm (Wharton Consulting Group speaking on COMPUTERSHARE, argues the era of holders acquiescing to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 324.72 Tm (whatever states and auditors demanded is over: with litigation now on the books, 'people aren't afraid to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 309.50 Tm (fight,' and if an auditor position does not feel right, Borden would say no even if that leads to litigation) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 294.27 Tm ([03CoUEgqdzg @ 00:01:47]. The opposite playbook is the voluntary on-ramp. Friedman LLP pitches) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 279.05 Tm (voluntary disclosure as the escape hatch: a look-back typically limited to about ten years, waived penalties,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 263.82 Tm (and in some states a waived due diligence requirement, versus an audit that can reach back to the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 248.60 Tm (beginning of the business [duwB7Y82flc @ 00:41:49]. Tennessee sells the same trade through its) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 233.37 Tm (Compliance Disclosure Agreement, where the holder submits a proposal of Reporting Method worksheet) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 218.15 Tm (and the division never physically reviews the company's unclaimed property records [KiR-ZUeCE5g @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 202.92 Tm (00:02:20]. The view from the Utah audit desk undercuts the adversarial framing entirely: that auditor reports) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 187.70 Tm (most businesses simply do not know what they are doing, want to do what's right, and run smoothly as soon) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 172.47 Tm (as they are trained, with real fraud very rarely found [3B5mPVcKPDE @ 00:07:56]. The choice is litigated) Tj ET
